BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DJ Ahmet
DTSTART:20260416T000000Z
DTEND:20260416T020500Z
DTSTAMP:20260416T000000Z
UID:oyDJE4YMlS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nFifteen-year-old shepherd Ahmet 
 rebels against his conservative North Macedonian farming village when he g
 ets a taste of electronic dance music in this heartwarming dramedy\, winne
 r of the World Cinema – Audience Award Prize at Sundance 2025.\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/dj-ahmet\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
